<title>PORTUGAL: INE to issue Portugal inflation data Wednesday.</title>
<headline>INE to issue Portugal inflation data Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) will issue the December consumer price index (CPI) on Wednesday at 1500 GMT, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
</text>
